{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121218001:0":{"text":"역시 블랙골드 여사의 딸답게 공격도 어마 무시하네. 나 지금 갈비뼈 두세 개정도 부러진 것 같은데...","source_cn":"这姑娘下手可真狠，不愧是黑金女士的女儿，我的肋骨可能断...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD271C890C7277FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121218002:1":{"text":"저 아이가 정말 그 사람의 딸일까요? 날개를 자세히 확인해 보세요.","source_cn":"她真是那人的女儿吗？你们仔细看她的翅膀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA08AF576BB545B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121218003:1":{"text":"음... 겉으로 봤을 땐 블랙골드 여사랑 그리 닮은 것 같진 않아요.","source_cn":"嗯……从外貌来看，确实和黑金女士不怎么像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433B33BF39BFD8D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1121218003":{"text":"음... 겉으로 봤을 땐 블랙골드 여사랑 그리 닮은 것 같진 않아요.","source_cn":"嗯……从外貌来看，确实和黑金女士不怎么像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433B33BF39BFD8D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121218004:0":{"text":"제가 트라이브 부족에 대해 많이 아는 건 아니지만, 가녀린 체형부터 블랙골드 여사랑은 너무 다른데요.","source_cn":"我对蛮血部落的了解不算特别多，但她的身形纤细轻盈，不太像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DFDEB9B4D419071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121218005:0":{"text":"오히려 저 아이는... 우리 쪽 사람 같아 보여요.","source_cn":"她更像是……我们那的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78872F8D0A45204C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121218009:0":{"text":"그런데 왜 블랙골드 여사를 엄마라고 부르는 걸까요?","source_cn":"所以她为什么会把黑金女士称为母亲呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94B7B6143B225B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121218010:1":{"text":"양딸일 수도 있어요.","source_cn":"可能是养女。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87233B702114DC08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121218011:0":{"text":"아니, 난 엄마의 하나밖에 없는 친딸이야. 내 첫 기억은 바로 엄마의 웃는 얼굴이고.","source_cn":"不，我是妈妈唯一的亲女儿，我最早的记忆便是妈妈的笑脸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA8D4F4D48FA305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121218012:1":{"text":"어쩔 수 없이 네 아버지의 신분이 궁금해지는걸.","source_cn":"那我不禁要好奇你父亲的身份了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x003F09B5B2151D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121218013:0":{"text":"아버지...?","source_cn":"父亲是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79ABF52EF1CB41A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121218014:1":{"text":"음, 설마 아버지가 없는 거야?","source_cn":"呃，难道你没有父亲？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85BBA09C4BCA3FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121218015:0":{"text":"그게 뭔데, 무기 이름이야?","source_cn":"父亲是一种武器吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E206D92597F67D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121218016:0":{"text":"아버지라는 단어를 이해 못 하는구나?","source_cn":"你不理解父亲这个词语吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8851B2D43B82D521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121218017:0":{"text":"처음 들어.","source_cn":"第一次听说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF74A6FEF3861C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121218018:1":{"text":"조금 전 그 사람이 널 알파 일레븐이라고 부르던데. 너의 코드명이야?","source_cn":"刚才那些人称呼你为阿尔法十一，这是你的代号？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588B7FDD45C07688","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121218019:0":{"text":"내 이름이야.","source_cn":"是我的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B34E1F7EDCB62F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121218020:1":{"text":"사람 이름 같지는 않은데...","source_cn":"这可不像什么正经名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA6CD679CE364C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121218021:0":{"text":"이름 맞아. 엄마가 지어준 거야.","source_cn":"是名字，妈妈为我取的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF80A78E7EA69B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121218022:1":{"text":"정말 이상한 애네... 사람들을 다치게 했으니, 우선은 성석 마을로 데려가서 호건 장군님께 넘기도록 하죠.","source_cn":"真是个奇怪的女孩……她伤了不少人，我们先把她带回圣石镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA54E062A651C231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"트라이브 같아","source_cn":"她像蛮血部落的人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25787FCB5A9E04B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"트라이브 같아","female":"트라이브 같아","variant_male_record_index":"63252","variant_female_record_index":"63253","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121218006:1":{"text":"저도 그렇게 생각해요.","source_cn":"我也这么认为。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC107177B47FA4BE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"와일더스 같아","source_cn":"她像绿裔联盟的人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0575B786C1B4BDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"와일더스 같아","female":"와일더스 같아","variant_male_record_index":"63254","variant_female_record_index":"63255","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121218007:1":{"text":"또 농담하시네요. 그레이브본의 눈동자는 은은한 녹색 빛이 비치잖아요. 하지만 저 아이는 전혀 아니에요.","source_cn":"你又在开玩笑，我知道亡灵眷族的眼瞳里烁动着幽幽绿光。她...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x03A8CB7A89ABEEBD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 농담하시네요. 그레이브본의 눈동자는 은은한 녹색 빛이 비치잖아요. 하지만 저 아이는 전혀 아니에요.","female":"또 농담하시네요. 그레이브본의 눈동자는 은은한 녹색 빛이 비치잖아요. 하지만 저 아이는 전혀 아니에요.","variant_male_record_index":"118641","variant_female_record_index":"118642","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121218008:1":{"text":"분위기를 보니 와일더스 연맹 사람 같네요.","source_cn":"看她的气质，倒是像绿裔联盟的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFFA4207DAABA75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:2:3":{"text":"그레이브본 같아","source_cn":"她像亡灵眷族的人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB40386D685DCDD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그레이브본 같아","female":"그레이브본 같아","variant_male_record_index":"